1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,731
Try it on copper and iron.

2
00:00:01,731 --> 00:00:03,450
Iron comes before copper.

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:10,703
So through the cold junction, the current flows from iron to copper, and through the hot junction, from copper to iron.

4
00:00:10,703 --> 00:00:12,226
Round the loop it goes.

